Package: georgiacivicdata
Title: Access Public Data from 'Georgia Civic Data'
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Shane", "Orr", , "shane.j.orr@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: A client for the 'Georgia Civic Data' REST API
    <https://georgiacivicdata.org/api/v1>, which publishes cleaned public
    data about Georgia: education (graduation, assessments, enrollment,
    attendance and school accountability), U.S. Census context,
    immigration and health, at state, county, school district, school and
    Census tract level. Find datasets by topic or plain-language search,
    read their schemas, and download filtered rows as tidy data frames
    with place names beside codes and columns typed from each dataset's
    schema. Also returns school attendance zones and district boundaries
    as 'sf' objects, and finds the county, tract, school district and
    zoned schools for points or street addresses.
